= FAQ

#metadata(none) <sec-FAQ>

*My testing mode doesn't work*#linebreak()#v(-1.8pt) To enable testing mode, make sure that you enabled the testing mode of the flight computer first with the configurator, and that a valid testing password is set. Otherwise, the flight computer will start in the default mode and not accept any testing commands sent by the ground station.#linebreak()#linebreak()#v(1.8pt)

*The Configurator sometimes doesn't accept what I configure*#linebreak()#v(-1.8pt) Try bypassing any sort of USB hub if you see issues with the Configurator. If that doesn't help, write to us on Discord or submit an issue on GitHub.#linebreak()#linebreak()#v(1.8pt)

*To be extended with user feedback...*#linebreak()#linebreak()#v(1.8pt)
